WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Marisa completes the forward dash toward the knocked-down Ryu.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.050
Marisa walks forward from the dash into throw range.

3
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:02.850
The normal throw catches the recorded waking Ryu.

4
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.550
Ryu is knocked down by the throw.
